    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Unity to Survive&quot; is a third-person co-op shooter where up to 4 players team up to survive relentless waves of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through ever-intensifying stages, upgrade your weapons and abilities, and take down massive bosses with teamwork and strategy.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your loadout and develop your own survival style in an action-packed battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Online 4-player co-op  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Endless monster waves and dynamic stages  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Real-time upgrade and reward system  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Intense boss battles</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Unity to Survive&quot; is a third-person co-op shooter where up to 4 players team up to survive relentless waves of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through ever-intensifying stages, upgrade your weapons and abilities, and take down massive bosses with teamwork and strategy.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your loadout and develop your own survival style in an action-packed battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Online 4-player co-op  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Endless monster waves and dynamic stages  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Real-time upgrade and reward system  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714\ufe0f Intense boss battles</p>",
